SUMMARY:Adult Kickball - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nCome join u
 s for two to three hours of kickball.\n\nThe event is scheduled for Columb
 us Park\, 71 W Franklin St\, Hackensack\, because it has a huge grass fiel
 d.\n\nWe'll grab a kickball\, some bases and split up into teams to play. 
 Comment below if you have your own to bring. There are a ton of parking sp
 aces on West Franklin Street.\n\n\\*\\*\\*After playing\, we'll likely be 
 heading to Tropical Juice Bar\, 60 River St.\, Hackensack. Feel free to su
 ggest another spot to hang out if you've got one in mind. \\*\\*\\*\n\nThe
 re's no fee to play and nothing else you need to do besides show up. Come 
 anytime!! All are welcome!!! We're not in a league and are not here to ana
 lyze your form. We're here for people who haven't played in months\, maybe
  years\, and just want to play again and/or hang out.\n\nHope you'll join 
 us for our 5th kickball event. Questions or comments? You can message Andy
  on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609.\n\n\\*\\*\\* We are looking
  into some other spots for future kickball games. If you have ideas\, feel
  free to share. \\*\\*\\*\n\nCheck out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, ten
 nis\, skating or one of our other activities at: [www.meetup.com/north-jer
 sey-bowling-soccer-volleyball](https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling
 -soccer-volleyball)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316245854/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260823T220653Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260823T220653Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
