SUMMARY:Let’s Play Pickleball! Overpeck Park
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\n**This Pick
 leball event is for beginners / intermediates. Please bring your own pickl
 eball paddle and balls. (I only have a few extra paddles/balls).**\n\nBrin
 g water if you want to stay hydrated and snacks in case you get hungry.\n\
 nPlease be aware that since I am not able to reserve a court(s) in advance
 \, we might have to wait for a court to open up! If there are many RSVPs\,
  we can take turns on the court.\n\nWe will meet at the pickleball courts\
 , which are across the street from the Overpeck Park Amphitheater.\n\nLiab
 ility Waiver:\nHiking\, Pickleball\, Walking and other outdoor activities 
 have inherent risks. Your participation in our events could be dangerous a
 nd can result in severe injury\, medical emergency\, even death. You agree
  to participate in this event completely at your own risk and to take full
  responsibility for your own safety and well-being\, including those of yo
 ur guests.\n\nThere are restroom facilities available across the street fr
 om the pickleball courts.\n\nIf you are not coming\, please change your rs
 vp accordingly. Thank you!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316405933/
